      "writtenOn": "2022-07-05T12:55:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Would be great to standardize the prefix of all our \"soft\" bindings, @jrosenth what do you think? We don\u0027t have a registered one in vendor-prefixes.txt (thought we did...). I think it\u0027s cool to submit this as is since it\u0027s coherent with other bindings there but let\u0027s open a separate conversation about it.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 3,
        "startChar": 13,
        "endLine": 3,
        "endChar": 32
