      "writtenOn": "2022-07-05T23:48:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There has been some use of \u0027cros-ec\u0027 as a prefix. I don\u0027t mind either way - I was trying to tie this to the \u0027named-gpios\u0027 compatible, and I guess it is unlikely either of these will end up upstream, so I was less concerned about getting the prefix right.",
